# Read by Git Bash on Windows runners: a CRLF checkout puts \r into every checksum filename and script line.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sha256 text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
# Text the coordinator and the model read: a CRLF checkout breaks fenced-block parsing and byte budgets in tests,
# and ships \r into every line of the instructions and references the model reads (each costs tokens).
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
